request:
Plan: two 10 x 10 x 50 bars end to end (steel 0 to 50, aluminium 50 to 100), bonded with a tie at x = 50. Steel end (x = 0) fixed, 5 kN pull in +X on the aluminium end. Material keys steel_generic and al_6061_t6 (alloy not stated, 6061 assumed). Hand calcs: axial stretch of each bar; the total is their sum.

